WEBVTT

00:00.540 --> 00:09.420
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.570 --> 00:09.420
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.940 --> 00:18.510
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.940 --> 00:18.510
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.650 --> 00:37.230
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.650 --> 00:37.230
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.790
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.790
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.150
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.150
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.310 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.310 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.770 --> 01:14.820
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.780 --> 01:14.820
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.840 --> 01:22.810
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.840 --> 01:22.810
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.710 --> 01:30.670
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.580 --> 01:33.920
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.660 --> 01:35.990
Black Jack.

01:48.380 --> 01:52.250
Doc, doesn't this weather feel great?

01:53.790 --> 01:55.220
How far are we walking?

01:55.290 --> 02:00.310
We have to walk and exercise from
time to time, or we'll get rusty.

02:00.620 --> 02:04.420
I am responsible for keeping your health in check.

02:04.670 --> 02:09.540
Besides, men get fat and get big
bellies when they grow up.

02:09.760 --> 02:12.350
I will not forgive you if you get fat.

02:12.350 --> 02:14.890
I will not take you as my groom.

02:18.600 --> 02:21.360
Doc, wait!

02:23.480 --> 02:24.780
Welcome.

02:25.280 --> 02:28.110
Jumbo Deluxe Chocolate Parfait, extra large.

02:28.110 --> 02:28.990
Yes.

02:28.990 --> 02:29.950
I'll have coffee.

02:30.280 --> 02:30.870
Yes.

02:35.880 --> 02:38.790
Book: The journal of a disabled individual.

02:40.990 --> 02:43.760
Here you go, the Pinoco Special.

02:43.930 --> 02:45.850
Yay, great!

02:46.850 --> 02:47.930
And here is yours.

02:52.350 --> 02:56.020
Doc, doesn't it feel good to exercise?

02:59.740 --> 03:01.360
Thank you.

03:01.360 --> 03:03.880
And, thanks for this book.

03:04.070 --> 03:04.740
Sure.

03:04.740 --> 03:06.320
Be careful on your way home.

03:07.810 --> 03:08.880
Thanks.

03:09.350 --> 03:10.370
Come again.

03:15.840 --> 03:18.250
His name is Mitsuo-kun.

03:18.250 --> 03:21.800
He stops by on his way home every
time he visits the hospital.

03:22.630 --> 03:23.510
The hospital?

03:23.840 --> 03:26.930
He goes for rehabilitation every month.

03:26.930 --> 03:29.390
I heard it's from an accident a while back,

03:29.470 --> 03:31.680
and his injuries have completely healed,

03:31.680 --> 03:35.360
but his legs won't move like normal.

03:35.860 --> 03:38.940
He reads this book every time he's here.

03:53.210 --> 03:54.210
Come on.

03:54.500 --> 03:55.460
Come on.

03:57.590 --> 03:59.130
Yeah, get up!

03:59.130 --> 03:59.880
Stand up!

04:00.710 --> 04:02.590
Yeah, stand up and walk.

04:02.590 --> 04:03.840
Walk! Walk!

04:03.840 --> 04:04.840
That's it!

04:04.970 --> 04:05.870
Go on!

04:06.180 --> 04:07.140
Yeah, that's it!

04:07.460 --> 04:08.170
Yeah!

04:08.250 --> 04:08.730
Come on!

04:10.550 --> 04:13.790
The Ant's Legs

04:20.110 --> 04:23.660
Mitsuo-kun, can we have a word with you?

04:23.780 --> 04:25.280
I'm off now.

04:25.990 --> 04:30.080
Everyone, I will keep in touch, so please don't follow me.

04:30.100 --> 04:32.080
Mi-cchan, be careful.

04:32.180 --> 04:34.010
If you feed bad, then call...

04:34.030 --> 04:35.030
I know.

04:35.050 --> 04:36.290
I'll be fine, Mom.

04:44.300 --> 04:45.220
Mi-cchan!

04:46.260 --> 04:47.640
Don't help me!

04:48.010 --> 04:49.730
I want to try-this alone!

04:49.930 --> 04:51.010
Don't disturb me!

04:59.990 --> 05:00.980
Good luck!

05:03.030 --> 05:05.510
A boy's journey has just begun.

05:05.820 --> 05:08.290
It's approximately 400 km from Hiroshima to Osaka.

05:08.570 --> 05:12.330
As rehabilitation for his legs and a challenge for himself,

05:12.330 --> 05:15.660
he heads for the goal on his own.

05:18.750 --> 05:21.790
Doc, he's the same kid from the other day.

05:23.800 --> 05:30.220
Onion, carrots, and potatoes, all in here,

05:30.220 --> 05:31.930
meat and...

05:33.310 --> 05:34.640
Doc!

05:35.520 --> 05:37.680
Dinner will be ready soon.

05:37.690 --> 05:39.270
Where are you going?

05:39.270 --> 05:42.150
I felt like taking my time and taking a trip by myself.

05:42.980 --> 05:44.360
I'll come too!

05:44.980 --> 05:46.480
You'll stay home.

05:49.110 --> 05:51.950
I won't forgive you if you're going on a date!

06:19.600 --> 06:20.850
Keep it up!

06:20.850 --> 06:21.860
I'm cheering for you too!

06:24.360 --> 06:26.430
<i>My challenge has just begun.</i>

06:26.900 --> 06:28.770
<i>My legs are doing fine, too.</i>

06:29.150 --> 06:32.800
<i>The journey will be tough.</i>

06:33.410 --> 06:37.830
<i>But I will complete it, just like that brave patient.</i>

06:39.040 --> 06:40.890
Thank you.

06:40.950 --> 06:41.620
Oh?

06:41.670 --> 06:42.500
Look.

06:42.500 --> 06:43.960
Oh, he's...

06:43.960 --> 06:45.440
He's the boy on TV.

06:45.840 --> 06:47.130
Good luck.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.630
We're cheering for you too.

06:50.380 --> 06:51.510
Keep it up!

07:09.570 --> 07:10.490
That's...!

07:13.530 --> 07:14.740
I know him.

07:17.540 --> 07:18.580
Please wait!

07:18.830 --> 07:19.780
I told you.

07:20.080 --> 07:21.590
The fee is 30,000,000 yen.

07:21.750 --> 07:23.460
Not a penny less.

07:23.460 --> 07:24.870
That's impossible.

07:25.170 --> 07:26.920
That's over their limit.

07:27.380 --> 07:30.090
Then do something yourselves.

07:33.680 --> 07:35.140
Can we make a deal?
Oh, wait!

07:35.390 --> 07:37.180
Who's the man in the black cloak?

07:37.430 --> 07:39.510
He is Black Jack.

07:39.520 --> 07:42.810
He was called to this hospital for a very complex surgery.

07:43.100 --> 07:44.350
Black Jack?

07:45.440 --> 07:46.770
He's a doctor?

07:47.520 --> 07:52.690
He's known as a genius surgeon, but
he only deals with rich people.

07:53.280 --> 07:56.700
Only those who are willing to pay lots of money.

07:57.320 --> 07:58.560
<i>Black Jack...</i>

07:58.870 --> 08:00.370
<i>Why is he here?</i>

08:04.670 --> 08:09.040
I'm sure Doc is working somewhere.

08:09.040 --> 08:13.260
I'm going to feed him my cooking when he gets back.

08:21.810 --> 08:24.020
Ohmigewdness!

08:27.060 --> 08:31.070
But, Sir, isn't it a bit reckless,

08:31.070 --> 08:33.410
walking such a long distance without any company?

08:33.780 --> 08:36.950
I might start relying on that person if I'm with someone.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.910
Is that so?

08:39.120 --> 08:41.480
Sure, I think it's reckless too.

08:41.910 --> 08:45.080
But I'm doing it, and am fully aware of the consequences.

08:46.210 --> 08:49.110
This book is a journal of one disabled individual.

08:49.540 --> 08:54.550
That patient made a long journey to train his disabled legs.

08:55.510 --> 08:58.200
I was touched after reading that journal.

08:58.680 --> 09:01.430
I decided that I would do the same thing!

09:02.110 --> 09:04.560
I should be able to do it.

09:04.810 --> 09:07.640
How long will it take to get to Osaka?

09:07.900 --> 09:11.610
Dunno... Days, or months.

09:44.310 --> 09:50.600
<i>Following the same course written in the book
makes me feel like I'm walking with that patient.</i>

09:51.940 --> 09:55.610
<i>It's a tough and harsh journey, but it's also exciting.</i>

09:56.070 --> 09:59.490
<i>Anyway, that Black Jack...</i>

10:17.010 --> 10:19.470
Why are you following me?

10:20.680 --> 10:21.380
No reason.

10:22.300 --> 10:25.890
Then don't worry about me, Dr. Black Jack!

10:26.560 --> 10:28.350
You know me?

10:28.520 --> 10:29.600
I do.

10:30.390 --> 10:32.310
You're a doctor who specializes in rich people, right?

10:34.570 --> 10:37.190
I don't want any help from you.

10:37.530 --> 10:39.420
I'm not rich.

10:39.650 --> 10:44.320
Oh, and the TV stations are covering this journey,

10:44.330 --> 10:46.280
so are you wanting your name in it?

10:47.450 --> 10:50.620
I don't have any intention of diagnosing you,

10:50.620 --> 10:52.620
or having my name in the mass media.

10:53.210 --> 10:55.610
Then, why are you following me?

10:55.920 --> 10:57.460
I'm just watching you.

10:57.880 --> 11:00.220
Are you just mocking me?

11:00.550 --> 11:01.930
Just don't mind me!

11:10.560 --> 11:12.060
<i>Today was the worst day.</i>

11:12.690 --> 11:14.690
<i>I couldn't walk as much because of the rain,</i>

11:14.690 --> 11:16.770
<i>and I only covered half as much as I had planned to.</i>

11:17.230 --> 11:20.020
<i>On top of that, I talked to Black Jack.</i>

11:20.820 --> 11:26.570
<i>He wouldn't know how people like
me feel, trying their hardest.</i>

11:34.040 --> 11:35.960
What are you driving like a turtle for?!

11:55.100 --> 11:56.060
There's a wildfire!

11:56.060 --> 11:57.310
The smoke will get us!

11:57.310 --> 11:58.540
Get out of here quick!

11:58.730 --> 11:59.980
It's not safe here!

12:20.380 --> 12:21.250
Do you want a ride?

12:22.170 --> 12:23.170
No!

12:23.720 --> 12:26.760
Then crawl out of here.

12:27.260 --> 12:28.430
What?!

12:31.810 --> 12:33.060
Crawl?

12:33.930 --> 12:35.100
Crawl?

12:36.150 --> 12:38.350
Oh yeah! The smoke will only rise!

12:40.070 --> 12:42.320
I can breathe easier this way.

12:57.300 --> 12:59.550
<i>The fatigue is increasing.</i>

12:59.840 --> 13:02.110
<i>My legs are as heavy as lead.</i>

13:02.470 --> 13:04.530
<i>To be honest, it's tough.</i>

13:05.140 --> 13:06.530
<i>I want to quit right now.</i>

13:07.060 --> 13:09.020
<i>I wonder if that patient felt the same way.</i>

13:09.480 --> 13:11.690
<i>Or was he never discouraged?</i>

13:12.350 --> 13:14.900
<i>I could talk a lot if he was with me.</i>

13:20.160 --> 13:20.930
Hey!

13:20.930 --> 13:22.930
Weren't you on TV?

13:22.930 --> 13:24.810
Say, can you give us some money?

13:25.100 --> 13:27.060
Isn't the trip long?

13:27.060 --> 13:28.520
You've got money, right?

13:30.440 --> 13:31.690
Who are you?!

13:31.860 --> 13:33.440
Come on, man.

13:33.980 --> 13:34.820
Give us some!

13:34.820 --> 13:35.430
Stop it!

13:35.690 --> 13:37.400
How could you do this, knowing who I am!?

13:37.610 --> 13:39.030
So what?

13:39.780 --> 13:41.570
Come on.

13:41.620 --> 13:42.740
Got it!

13:44.170 --> 13:45.090
Give it back!

13:45.330 --> 13:47.330
Come after us if you want it back!

13:57.050 --> 13:58.260
Who the hell are you?

13:58.260 --> 13:59.470
Watch where you're going!

14:00.880 --> 14:02.390
Give me the wallet you stole.

14:02.850 --> 14:04.140
What?

14:04.300 --> 14:06.060
Why don't you take it back yourself?

14:10.140 --> 14:10.520
Damn!

14:35.500 --> 14:36.500
It's mine.

14:50.350 --> 14:53.350
Bring one more extra large Pinoco Special!

14:53.350 --> 14:54.690
Jeez!

14:54.690 --> 14:55.770
Doc!

14:56.400 --> 14:57.400
He's so cold!

14:57.400 --> 14:59.820
Are you sure you can eat so much, Pinoco-chan?

15:00.450 --> 15:01.380
I'm fine.

15:01.400 --> 15:03.490
Just bring out more!

15:04.060 --> 15:08.460
I know Doc is eating something yummy somewhere.

15:04.740 --> 15:06.720
The next report is from Abe Kogen.

15:06.770 --> 15:08.170
Umeda-san?

15:08.170 --> 15:09.020
Yes.

15:09.240 --> 15:13.150
Mitsuo-kun's journey, introduced
earlier, is now nearing its end.

15:13.230 --> 15:16.920
He has just 40 km to his goal, Osaka.

15:14.830 --> 15:16.920
Mitsuo-kun is still keeping it up.

15:17.090 --> 15:19.170
Yeah, what a tough kid.

15:21.300 --> 15:23.470
<i>My challenge is almost over.</i>

15:24.220 --> 15:28.850
<i>I wonder how that patient in the book
felt when he accomplished it?</i>

15:29.600 --> 15:32.100
<i>I will know myself soon.</i>

15:54.080 --> 15:55.370
You're here again?!

15:55.370 --> 15:57.880
Would you please stop following me?!

15:57.880 --> 16:00.040
I don't want to see you anymore!

16:00.550 --> 16:02.270
This incline is really tough.

16:02.670 --> 16:06.720
By the time you've climbed to the
top, the sun will be setting.

16:07.010 --> 16:08.140
I don't want your advice!

16:09.100 --> 16:13.430
You'd better head back to a store
and buy a blanket or sleeping bag.

16:13.430 --> 16:15.640
You'll catch a cold if you camp out like that.

16:15.810 --> 16:17.900
I can't climb it in a day?

16:17.900 --> 16:20.020
But even the turtle passed the rabbit.

16:20.020 --> 16:20.940
Just watch!

16:24.900 --> 16:27.490
But you're not thinking about the incline.

16:27.490 --> 16:30.160
You need as much energy as it takes
to climb stairs that are 45 degrees.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.580
Don't make fun of me!

16:31.580 --> 16:32.660
This is nothing!

16:40.000 --> 16:41.250
I don't think you can do it.

16:41.710 --> 16:45.340
The sun will set when you're at the curve after this incline.

16:45.920 --> 16:49.930
I believe even the book by Honma Jotaro
doesn't mention anything about this hill.

16:52.260 --> 16:53.600
Did you...

16:53.600 --> 16:55.520
Did you read that book too?

16:56.100 --> 16:58.560
Dr. Honma doesn't know this either.

17:00.020 --> 17:04.030
Back then, there was a big tree
by the curve, and I slept there.

17:04.740 --> 17:06.280
That tree is now gone.

17:14.370 --> 17:16.950
So, the patient in this book is...

17:18.040 --> 17:21.670
is that patient really you?

17:22.130 --> 17:28.200
The course you're walking is the
same course that I walked before.

17:28.760 --> 17:32.600
My savior, Dr. Honma, recorded it for me.

17:32.810 --> 17:35.740
But you have a normal body.

17:36.180 --> 17:37.060
So why?

17:46.860 --> 17:51.570
Due to an accident, I was unable to move
not only my legs, but my arms as well.

18:05.880 --> 18:08.420
The main surgeon for that case was Dr. Honma.

18:09.590 --> 18:15.010
Dr. Honma didn't give up, and
reconnected torn-up pieces of my body.

18:15.720 --> 18:19.100
But even after the surgery was over, and the bandages came off,

18:19.100 --> 18:22.480
my arms and legs wouldn't move like I wanted them to.

18:24.940 --> 18:28.600
I did some reckless things to make my
arms and legs move like they used to.

18:29.030 --> 18:31.150
This hike was one of them.

18:39.620 --> 18:44.170
You were walking the same course,
so it brought back my memories.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.920
So I was watching you.

18:47.500 --> 18:49.210
P-please wait!

18:49.210 --> 18:51.050
I want to talk with you more.

18:51.510 --> 18:53.840
Like, how you felt when you completed the journey.

18:54.300 --> 18:56.420
You don't want any company, right?

18:56.680 --> 18:59.060
And I don't feel like staying with you anymore.

19:00.560 --> 19:01.900
This is a tough spot.

19:02.140 --> 19:04.730
Once you clear this spot, it will be flat until the end.

20:40.200 --> 20:41.120
A blanket...

21:01.010 --> 21:02.060
Here you go.

21:03.180 --> 21:04.310
Here you go!

21:03.290 --> 21:05.820
We have a report from Osaka.

21:07.300 --> 21:08.480
Ogata-san?

21:08.520 --> 21:11.380
Yes, let's get to the interview.

21:11.420 --> 21:12.700
Congratulations for finishing it, Mitsuo-kun.

21:13.610 --> 21:14.900
How do you feel about completing the journey?

21:15.740 --> 21:19.200
I completed it because of everyone's support.

21:19.200 --> 21:20.370
Thank you, everyone.

21:20.780 --> 21:24.240
He's really great, walking all that way.

21:26.330 --> 21:29.120
So different from you, Doc!

21:29.120 --> 21:31.330
Pinoco, would you stop being upset already?

21:33.880 --> 21:36.800
But, you never called me!

21:36.800 --> 21:38.880
I was so worried!

21:38.880 --> 21:39.800
I'm just...

21:40.180 --> 21:41.010
I'm just...

21:41.010 --> 21:44.810
Okay, I'll take you to the zoo then

21:44.810 --> 21:45.300
OK?

21:45.300 --> 21:46.850
The zoo?!

21:46.850 --> 21:48.690
I want to see the white lion!

21:49.350 --> 21:51.400
Yay!

22:07.080 --> 22:19.040
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.080 --> 22:19.040
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.160 --> 22:24.160
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.160 --> 22:24.160
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.730 --> 22:31.190
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.730 --> 22:31.190
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.740 --> 22:37.200
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.740 --> 22:37.200
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.800 --> 22:40.290
being heated up by you,

22:37.800 --> 22:40.290
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.490 --> 22:48.270
so much that I change color

22:40.490 --> 22:48.270
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.360 --> 23:00.130
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.360 --> 23:00.130
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.330 --> 23:12.060
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.330 --> 23:12.060
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.300 --> 23:23.660
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.300 --> 23:23.660
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.840 --> 23:28.760
I couldn't be happier

23:23.840 --> 23:28.760
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.990 --> 23:33.920
How does it taste?

23:28.990 --> 23:33.920
oaji wa ikaga?

23:47.042 --> 23:48.042
A doctor?

23:48.382 --> 23:49.302
It's a she?

23:50.212 --> 23:52.422
I have the perfect name for this dog.

23:56.052 --> 23:57.392
Very well done.

24:01.482 --> 24:02.312
Pinoco!

24:03.272 --> 24:05.982
Which is more important, the dog's life or your own?!

24:05.982 --> 24:07.362
Doc, you idiot!

24:08.182 --> 24:08.952
I...

24:09.822 --> 24:10.582
What's this?!

24:10.032 --> 24:15.062
The Dog Thief

24:12.302 --> 24:14.542
Next Karte - The Dog Thief

24:15.677 --> 24:17.452
Pinoco's Diary...

24:18.302 --> 24:24.152
The course you're walking is the
same course I walked before.
